Description: Akatsuki Linux theme package
 Contains Plymouth boot splash, GRUB theme, GDM login theme,
 GNOME Shell and GTK themes, wallpapers, cursors, icons, fonts,
 sound effects, and welcome screen for Akatsuki Linux.
